## Additional Terms for Cosmic Council Framework

### Attribution

When using the Cosmic Council Framework in your projects, please include the following attribution:

```
Powered by the Cosmic Council Framework
https://cosmic-council.org
```

### Commercial Use

The Cosmic Council Framework is free for commercial use. However, if you use the framework in a commercial product that generates significant revenue (>$1M annually), we encourage you to:

1. Consider contributing back to the project
2. Support the development through sponsorship
3. Share your success stories with the community

### Enterprise Support

For enterprise deployments requiring:
- Commercial support
- Custom development
- Training and consulting
- SLA guarantees

Please contact us at enterprise@cosmic-council.org

### Trademark

"Cosmic Council" and the Cosmic Council logo are trademarks of the Cosmic Council Framework project. You may not use these trademarks without permission.

### Third-Party Components

This software includes third-party components with their own licenses:

- FastAPI: MIT License
- SQLAlchemy: MIT License
- PostgreSQL: PostgreSQL License
- Redis: BSD License
- OpenAI API: OpenAI Terms of Service
- Anthropic API: Anthropic Terms of Service

Please review the licenses of these components before use.

### Data and Privacy

The Cosmic Council Framework processes data according to our Privacy Policy:

- We do not store personal data unless explicitly provided
- Problem data is processed locally by default
- AI API calls may be logged for service improvement
- Users can opt out of data collection

### Security

If you discover a security vulnerability, please report it to security@cosmic-council.org

### Support

For support and questions:
- Documentation: https://docs.cosmic-council.org
- Community: https://community.cosmic-council.org
- Issues: https://github.com/cosmic-council/framework/issues
- Email: support@cosmic-council.org

### Contributing

We welcome contributions! Please see our Contributing Guide:
https://github.com/cosmic-council/framework/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md

### Code of Conduct

This project follows a Code of Conduct. Please read it before participating:
https://github.com/cosmic-council/framework/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md

